        "reference": "Deuteronomy 20:2",
        "book": "Deuteronomy",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And shall say unto them, Hear, O Israel, ye approach this day unto battle against your enemies: let not your hearts faint, fear not, and do not tremble, neither be ye terrified because of them;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Deuteronomy 20:3",
        "book": "Deuteronomy",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
