        "reference": "Deuteronomy 20:11",
        "book": "Deuteronomy",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And if it will make no peace with thee, but will make war against thee, then thou shalt besiege it:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Deuteronomy 20:12",
        "book": "Deuteronomy",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And when the Lord thy God hath delivered it into thine hands, thou shalt smite every male thereof with the edge of the sword:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Deuteronomy 20:13",
        "book": "Deuteronomy",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "But the women, and the little ones, and the cattle, and all that is in the city, even all the spoil thereof, shalt thou take unto thyself; and thou shalt eat the spoil of thine enemies, which the Lord thy God hath given thee.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 154,
            "end": 157,
            "text": "IE consume, enjoy."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 81,
            "end": 85
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Deuteronomy 20:14",
        "book": "Deuteronomy",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "Thus shalt thou do unto all the cities which are very far off from thee, which are not of the cities of these nations.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 48
          },
          {
            "start": 79,
            "end": 82
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
